::'''Green Hibiscus:''' You're finished? So soon? Let me see... Hmm... Hmm... Yes, it would appear you are finished &mdash; a fast and accurate transcription. It seems you are destined for immortality.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} So, can I join the Disciples of Sanctus Medicus now?
::'''Green Hibiscus:''' Calm yourself... The initiation is divided into two steps &mdash; you and the Cloud Knight have completed the first. Now... only the second remains.
::'''Strange Cloud Knight:''' Sure... but can it wait till tomorrow? I'm supposed to be on duty right now &mdash; they'll get suspicious if I don't head back soon.
::'''Green Hibiscus:''' No need to worry, the second step is extraordinarily simple. It'll all be over soon enough.
::'''Green Hibiscus:''' The Disciples' initiation is governed by the following principle &mdash; never accept who you suspect, and never suspect who you accept. So...
::'''Green Hibiscus:''' ...it's time for you two to battle it out. Whoever survives will officially become a disciple.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Why?
:::'''Green Hibiscus:''' Transcribing scripture allows us to ascertain your devotion, but determining whether or not you'll be loyal to the organization requires a stronger guarantee... Sorry, there's nothing I can do about it, I didn't write the rules.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'll pass...
:::'''Green Hibiscus:''' There is nothing that can be done. I didn't write the rules. If you are unwilling to complete the initiation process, then we will have to ask that you keep our secrets hidden... permanently...
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Okay. Let's fight!
:::'''Green Hibiscus:''' Excellent! The Disciples of Sanctus Medicus loves enthusiastic new blood! Well then, show us what you're made of!
::'''Strange Cloud Knight:''' Wh&mdash;Whoa, whoa &mdash; you're kidding, right? We came here to lengthen our lifespans, not shorten them! You can't just make us fight like this!
::'''Green Hibiscus:''' We aren't forcing you to fight &mdash; by all means refuse if you wish... but we won't possibly be able to let either of you leave.
::'''Strange Cloud Knight:''' I... Fine, fine &mdash; but at least let me prepare. I've never done anything like this before...
::'''Green Hibiscus:''' Very well, but you'll need to ask your opponent, too...
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I don't mind either.
::'''Green Hibiscus:''' Good. Then prepare yourselves. Time is precious &mdash; make it quick.
::----
:{{Диалог|Выход}} Okay. Just a moment.
::----
----
:'''Green Hibiscus:''' Here we are. This is the place.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How do I gain immortality?
::'''Green Hibiscus:''' Ah, let's not get ahead of ourselves. If it were so easy, we'd be a far larger group, and there'd be no need for secrecy.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What are you up to?
::'''Green Hibiscus:''' Relax. By the mercy of Sanctus Medicus, I will not harm you.
:'''Green Hibiscus:''' Allow me to reintroduce myself... I am a member of the Disciples of Sanctus Medicus. I was unable to expose my true identity in Exalting Sanctum, but now I can reveal everything.
:'''Green Hibiscus:''' The Disciples of Sanctus Medicus is a devout group, holding firm in their belief that Merciful Medicus is the one, ultimate faith. As followers, we refer to ourselves as disciples, dedicated to our cause.
:'''Green Hibiscus:''' If you wish to gain the means to immortality, then you must become a disciple... but to become a disciple, you must first pass several small trials.
:'''Green Hibiscus:''' Please excuse me... Our expansion has unfortunately attracted the attention of those Devilish Archer followers. If we are not careful, the consequences could be unthinkable.
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} What is this Cloud Knight doing here...?
::'''Green Hibiscus:''' No need to be concerned about him. Much like yourself, he is here to undergo the trials.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Don't the people of the Xianzhou abhor Abundance?
::'''Green Hibiscus:''' Haha. Only those led astray by followers of the Devilish Archer could despise Merciful Medicus. Sadly, there are many such people... too many.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} What can I get from Sanctus Medicus?
::'''Green Hibiscus:''' Every species yearns for the favor and curing of Merciful Medicus, regardless of whether they have heard of the Abundance or not.
::'''Green Hibiscus:''' Foxians yearn to cure themselves of their 300-year lifespan. The Vidyadhara yearn to cure themselves of the pain of reincarnation and lack of progeny...
::'''Green Hibiscus:''' ...As for Xianzhou natives &mdash; they long to cure themselves of the torture of becoming mara-struck. Of course, we know that this "torture" is rather a kind of blessed evolution.
::'''Green Hibiscus:''' To return to your question, Sanctus Medicus can cure the aging that short-life species face, along with disease and death. Sanctus Medicus can do for you what THEY did for the Xianzhou natives.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What kind of trial do I have to pass?
::'''Green Hibiscus:''' "What you seek, you will surely find." Merciful Medicus is magnanimous &mdash; they do not lightly refuse a prayer. As such, the initiation trials for the Disciples of Sanctus Medicus are nothing arduous.
::'''Green Hibiscus:''' All you must do is transcribe this copy of "Thousand-Handed Merciful Medicus' Salvation" 500 times by hand. This will allow your brothers and sisters to trust your faith... and you to become a disciple.
::'''Green Hibiscus:''' This scripture is central to the Disciples &mdash; you must maintain a pious heart during the transcription... It would be best if you could memorize the text.
::'''Green Hibiscus:''' Of course, this is but the first trial. Once you have become a disciple, you will undergo numerous others.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} 500 times seems excessive...
:::'''Green Hibiscus:''' Excessive? The old rules dictated that the text be copied 50,000 times &mdash; I myself undertook such a feat. Nowadays, the master takes greater pity on the common people, hence the number has been reduced to a mere 500.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Can I get a pen?
:::'''Green Hibiscus:''' Don't worry, a traditional Xianzhou brush and inkstone has been prepared for you &mdash; smooth action and an ergonomic design. I myself transcribed 50,000 copies with such instruments.
::----
{{Dialogue End}}

