:'''Qingzu:''' I'm glad to see you've returned in one piece.
::'''Qingzu:''' So, what happened? Did everything go as planned?
::'''Qingzu:''' Don't worry, your operation was a success &mdash; although your identity was ultimately exposed, you gained a wealth of invaluable intelligence. On top of that, you managed to get out without a scratch.
::'''Qingzu:''' *sigh* ...I never imagined that Zhixin would choose the path of evil.
::'''Qingzu:''' (Trailblazer), you did the right thing. I'm afraid this is how the Plagues Author operates &mdash; using notions of power and life to draw countless people like Zhixin away from bright futures... down a path of no return.
::'''Qingzu:''' You've managed to shine a light on the darkness of the enemy. With this intelligence, the Seat of Divine Foresight will be able to improve its strategy...
::'''Qingzu:''' ...and for all your efforts, please accept this reward.
::'''Qingzu:''' Is there anything else you'd like to know about?
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Tell me about the current state of the Disciples of Sanctus Medicus...
:::'''Qingzu:''' The current state... I'm afraid we know next to nothing. We dispatched agents, but they were only able to linger on the edges of the organization. Your operation is the furthest anyone's managed to infiltrate.
:::'''Qingzu:''' The Seat of Divine Foresight is still striving to answer one question: Is this but the resurgent shadow of an organization silenced a thousand years ago... or have they been lurking in the darkness all along?
:::'''Qingzu:''' Whatever the case, this sudden re-emergence hints at a hidden conspiracy...
:::'''Qingzu:''' It's troubled me deeply over recent few months... it's hard to tell what all of this is building towards.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Did you send a lot of people undercover?
