:::'''Qingzu:''' ...and the majority of them lacked the strength you had to make it back unscathed after their identity was exposed. They didn't have the wisdom and good fortune to gain the organization's trust quickly...
:::'''Qingzu:''' An agent can't actually consume those pellets of the Disciples... doing so would mean the end of their life as they knew it.
:::'''Qingzu:''' The point is, there hasn't been anyone like you who managed to delve into the group's core and obtain so much firsthand information.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Tell me about the beliefs of the Disciples of Sanctus Medicus...
:::'''Qingzu:''' Thousand-Handed Merciful Medicus' Salvation is a manuscript transcribed from a sacred text &mdash; I don't know where the Disciples obtained it. It likely consists of fragments of banned works from the {{Rubi|befall era|Theophany Era}}.
:::'''Qingzu:''' As I see it, there isn't anything particularly alarming about the text. It recalls the acts of the Plagues Author's warped creatures from an equally warped perspective...
:::'''Qingzu:''' The scripture doesn't have the power to lead people astray &mdash; they do that to themselves... but it does feed lies and false hope.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Выход}} About the prescription that Zhixin gave me...
:::'''Qingzu:''' The prescription you acquired is... beyond my knowledge.
:::'''Qingzu:''' There are a few reliable alchemists that reside in Exalting Sanctum. I'd like to ask you to consult with them on the particulars of the prescription. This will allow the Seat of Divine Foresight to have a clear target for creating an antidote...
:::'''Qingzu:''' (Trailblazer), given that the Disciples of Sanctus Medicus has become aware of our operation, it's about time the Seat of Divine Foresight reeled in its net.
:::'''Qingzu:''' If you turn up any details about the prescription, feel free to come back and find me any time.
:'''Qingzu:''' What's on your mind? Did you want to ask about something else?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I have some questions about the Disciples of Sanctus Medicus...
:::'''Qingzu:''' Ask away, I'll tell you everything I know.
:::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Tell me about the current state of the Disciples of Sanctus Medicus...
::::'''Qingzu:''' The current state... I'm afraid we know next to nothing. We dispatched agents, but they were only able to linger on the edges of the organization. Your operation is the furthest anyone's managed to infiltrate.
::::'''Qingzu:''' The Seat of Divine Foresight is still striving to answer one question: Is this but the resurgent shadow of an organization silenced a thousand years ago... or have they been lurking in the darkness all along?
::::'''Qingzu:''' Whatever the case, this sudden re-emergence hints at a hidden conspiracy...
::::'''Qingzu:''' It's troubled me deeply over recent few months... it's hard to tell what all of this is building towards.
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
:::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Did you send a lot of people undercover?
::::'''Qingzu:''' Not at all. The Disciples' secret letter makes it sound as if we infiltrated their ranks in great numbers... The reality is that only a handful of agents have successfully slipped into the organization...
::::'''Qingzu:''' ...and the majority of them lacked the strength you had to make it back unscathed after their identity was exposed. They didn't have the wisdom and good fortune to gain the organization's trust quickly...
::::'''Qingzu:''' An agent can't actually consume those pellets of the Disciples... doing so would mean the end of their life as they knew it.
::::'''Qingzu:''' The point is, there hasn't been anyone like you who managed to delve into the group's core and obtain so much firsthand information.
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
