::{{Диалог|Выход}} I don't have any more questions.
:::'''Qingzu:''' Very well, see you soon. Remember to look for those alchemists when you have time &mdash; ask them about the prescription. I can't leave my post right now.

;(Talk to Timid Alchemist)
