::'''Timid Alchemist:''' Uh... C&mdash;Can I help you with anything...?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Qingzu asked me to find you...
::'''Timid Alchemist:''' Right... I see. Let me take a look at the prescription. I'm afraid I'm not the most talented alchemist &mdash; I probably won't be able to make much sense of it...
::'''Timid Alchemist:''' Huh? Th&mdash;This calls for... Vidyadhara bone marrow? Whoever wrote this prescription must be out of their mind...
::'''Timid Alchemist:''' Sorry... I can't make heads or tails of it. The ingredients listed are just too... strange.
::'''Timid Alchemist:''' Based on what little I do know, I doubt the other alchemists will be able to understand it either... I think there's only one person who could grasp this kind of pharmacology...
