:'''Timid Alchemist:''' I'll wager she can wrap her head around this prescription.
:'''Timid Alchemist:''' When she's not working, she's usually enjoying the breeze over in Synwood Pavilion. Why don't you go and ask her about it?

;(Talk to Warm-Hearted Alchemist)
