::'''Warm-Hearted Alchemist:''' ...
::'''Warm-Hearted Alchemist:''' ...
::'''Warm-Hearted Alchemist:''' If this request had come from anywhere else, it would've seemed like a joke... but the Seat of Divine Foresight only deals in the serious...
::'''Warm-Hearted Alchemist:''' I can't understand this prescription, and I imagine that other alchemists won't be able to make sense of it either. I recommend you go directly to the chief alchemist, Lady Dan Shu.
::'''Warm-Hearted Alchemist:''' Lady Dan Shu is renowned for her unique line of reasoning. She's proposed several prescriptions that would have been incomprehensible to us if she hadn't explained the pharmacology...
::'''Warm-Hearted Alchemist:''' ...still, those same prescriptions have always been able to produce miraculous effects. Lady Dan Shu is a truly gifted alchemist.
::'''Warm-Hearted Alchemist:''' All the more amazing given her sightlessness, wouldn't you say?
;(Subsequent interactions)
:'''Warm-Hearted Alchemist:''' Lady Dan Shu likes to pass the time over at Synwood Pavilion &mdash; I'm sure you'll run into her if you head that way.

;(Talk to Ineloquent Alchemist)
